WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.660
I'm sorry

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.500
I don't want to be an emperor.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.120
That's not my business.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.060
I don't want to rule or conquer anyone.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.080
I should like to help everyone - if possible

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.720
Jew, Gentile - black man - white.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.600
We all want to help one another.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.480
Human beings are like that.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.140
We want to live by each other's happiness - not by each other’s misery

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.200
We don’t want to hate and despise one another.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:35.880
In this world there is room for everyone.

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:39.180
And the good earth is rich and can provide for everyone.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:42.240
The way of life can be free and beautiful,

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.380
but we have lost the way.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.180
Greed has poisoned men’s souls,

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.540
has barricaded the world with hate,

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.440
has goose-stepped us into misery and bloodshed.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.100
We have developed speed, but we have shut ourselves in.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.020
Machinery that gives abundance has left us in want.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.840
Our knowledge has made us cynical.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.260
Our cleverness, hard and unkind.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.100
We think too much and feel too little.

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.940
More than machinery we need humanity.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.840
More than cleverness we need kindness and gentleness.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:15.040
Without these qualities, life will be violent

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:16.820
and all will be lost…

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:19.740
The aeroplane and the radio have brought us closer together.

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:23.060
The very nature of these inventions cries out for the goodness in men

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.240
cries out for universal brotherhood - for the unity of us all.

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.460
Even now my voice is reaching millions throughout the world

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:32.740
millions of despairing men, women, and little children

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.660
victims of a system that makes men torture

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.580
and imprison innocent people.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.860
To those who can hear me, I say

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:41.480
do not despair.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.780
The misery that is now upon us is but the passing of greed

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:48.440
the bitterness of men who fear the way of human progress.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.480
The hate of men will pass

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:52.200
and dictators die

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.120
and the power they took from the people

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.660
will return to the people.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:59.200
And so long as men die, liberty will never perish.

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:03.340
Soldiers! don’t give yourselves to brutes

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:07.440
men who despise you - enslave you - who regiment your lives

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:09.580
tell you what to do - what to think and what to feel!

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.220
Who drill you - diet you

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:14.040
treat you like cattle, use you as cannon fodder.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:17.040
Don’t give yourselves to these unnatural men

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:20.240
machine men with machine minds and machine hearts!

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.720
You are not machines!

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:23.120
You are not cattle!

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.000
You are men!

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.620
You have the love of humanity in your hearts!

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:27.580
You don’t hate!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.060
Only the unloved hate

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.100
the unloved and the unnatural!

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.380
Soldiers! Don’t fight for slavery!

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.520
Fight for liberty!

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.940
In the 17th Chapter of St Luke it is written:

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.440
“the Kingdom of God is within man”

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:40.480
not one man nor a group of men

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.200
but in all men! In you!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.220
You, the people have the power

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.860
the power to create machines

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.400
The power to create happiness!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:51.040
You, the people, have the power to make this life free and beautiful

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:53.500
to make this life a wonderful adventure.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.140
Then - in the name of democracy

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.020
let us use that power - let us all unite!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.520
Let us fight for a new world

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.500
a decent world that will give men a chance to work

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:06.680
that will give youth a future and old age a security.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:08.020
By the promise of these things

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.760
brutes have risen to power.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:10.620
But they lie!

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.500
They do not fulfil that promise.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.480
They never will!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.680
Dictators free themselves

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.400
but they enslave the people!

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:20.480
Now let us fight to fulfil that promise!

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.980
Let us fight to free the world

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.200
to do away with national barriers

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:28.560
to do away with greed, with hate and intolerance.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:30.800
Let us fight for a world of reason

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.140
a world where science and progress

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.600
will lead to all men’s happiness.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.640
Soldiers! in the name of democracy,

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.500
let us all unite!

